ns travel by daylight is a privilege reserved only for the most trusted of Ghoul servants. In Werewolf domains humans can be hunted for sport for violating any number of spirit laws they are barred from ever learning. Mages are less likely to murder their subjects but do put them through pressing trials in hopes of spurring awakening.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Futura PT Book, Futura PT Book, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Still as long as humanity survives so to does the Vigil. The remnants of many compacts and conspiracies are still out there, hidden from the Camarilla*. They have begun to make contact with one another and have begun sharing intel as they prepare the strike back against the Camarilla* once more. Only Time will tell if they can put their differences behind them for the good of humanity this time.<br /> <br /> *Camarilla is a place holder name that honestly I'm not too fond of and want to replace with something with less setting and meta baggage.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> ((Next time I'll do a write up on Themes and Inspirations))</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Okay this is interesting, are you going to continue it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24642-mr-perfect-cell","name":"Mr.Perfect cell","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-15T18:11:48-07:00","id":1260794,"title":"","content":"Holy crap that is an awesome setting!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7272-ratet","name":"Ratet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2